   "id": "20201016-use-the-adr-slug-as-its-unique-id",
   "props": {
    "title": "Use the ADR slug as its unique ID",
    "summary": "From now on, we won't use ADR numbers anymore. An ADR will be uniquely identified by its slug (ie. its filename without the extension), and its filename will have the following format: YYYYMMDD-adr-title.md, with YYYYMMDD being the date of creation of the file. As a result, there won't have conflict",
